flowchart TD
  A["Independent tutor<br/>just the owner, team is off<br/>Settings, How you teach: Just you"] --> B["Add a colleague<br/>opens Add tutor, or Add team member"]
  B --> C["Invitation sent<br/>no switch, no dialog"]
  C --> D["Team turns on by itself"]
  D --> E["Tutors and Team pages appear<br/>Switch role appears in the account menu<br/>account card says TUTORING AGENCY"]
  D --> F["Courses, students, lessons and the account name<br/>stay exactly as they were"]
  E --> G["Owner gives the colleague courses<br/>colleague accepts, or declines"]
  G --> H{"Anyone else left on the account?<br/>active, or an invitation waiting"}
  H -->|"yes"| E
  H -->|"no, and the account started solo"| I["Team turns off by itself<br/>pages and Switch role disappear<br/>nothing is deleted"]
  H -->|"no, but the account started as a team"| M["Stays a team<br/>owner can add people again"]
  J["Removing a colleague who teaches"] --> K["Reassign step first, TM-06<br/>so no course is left without a tutor"]
  K --> H
